  "description": "Three years into working life, Woo-yu has lost all her youthful enthusiasm and innocence, living a dull and cynical routine. That is, when her first love from high school, Lee Yong-do, suddenly reappears. This accidental reunion in her dreary life feels like a gift. No, she thought it was. That is, until she realizes that their relationship is strictly divided into the absolute roles of superior and subordinate...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=855632), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14803003)",
